{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52298","headline":"诗（幷序） 五十九 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行善爲基路，偷盗五不作，耶●（张谓以上三字爲衍文）五不当（戴校二句作「偷盗吾不作，邪淫吾不当。\n」）。\n不解谗朝廷，不解佞君王。\n不能行左道，於中说一伤（张改作「场」）。\n一直逢阎夫，尽地取天堂。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}